  "notes": "Smart Playbook: one glowing panel with a single Start Playbook Autopilot button (no choices), a daily schedule up to the offer's deadline or 90 days out, and milestones from a refreshed offer join the plan. Faster phone control: the phone is read in parallel, picture games skip the slow screen-text dump, Falcor looks while the AI thinks, and moves that worked on a picture scene are reused. Closing purchase pop-ups is allowed (buying never is); Pause queue sits in Today's Queue. Phone app: header fixed, playbook panel styled.",
